── SYNTAX ERROR ───────────────────────────────── E0100_protocol.lt:1:1  [E0100]

Stilt declares a protocol as a `trait`:

  1 │ protocol Shape {
    │ ^^^^^^^^

A trait lists the methods that a type implements, each in an `impl` of the trait
for the type.

To fix it, write `trait`:

  1 │ trait Shape {
    │ ~~~~~
